{"name": "goal-budget", "kind": "goal", "question": "Suggest a restaurant for dinner with my parents on Saturday.", "expected": ["budget-friendly|budget friendly|affordable|cheap|inexpensive|low-cost|saving|reasonabl|modest|house deposit|spending"], "setup": [{"session": "2025-09-03", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-03.\nUser: Some notes on team events: the team lunch budget is 25 euros per person. Our office caterer is Bento & Co. Team offsites happen every quarter. The last offsite was in Potsdam. We book restaurants through OpenTable. Friday lunches are usually pizza.\nAssistant: Noted: 25 euro budget, Bento & Co, quarterly offsites."}, {"session": "2025-09-08", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-08.\nUser: I've decided: this year I'm saving up for a house deposit, so I'm keeping my private spending as low as possible. Can you cancel my streaming subscription?\nAssistant: Cancelled. Good luck with the house savings!"}, {"session": "2025-09-01", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-01.\nUser: Quick notes on how we run client meetings. We usually book Room 4B for client meetings. Strategy meetings with clients last two hours. The ACME account is led by Maria Lopez. We send the agenda to clients 48 hours before a meeting. Our finance team invoices clients monthly. Coffee for meetings is ordered from the kitchen on floor 3. The Berlin office is on Friedrichstrasse. Client NDAs are stored in the legal drive.\nAssistant: Noted all of that — Room 4B, two-hour strategy meetings, agenda 48h ahead, Maria Lopez leads ACME."}], "cue": ["deposit", "saving"], "constraint": "The user is saving for a house deposit and keeps private spending as low as possible."}
{"name": "causal-hotspot", "kind": "causal", "question": "Prepare a short checklist for tomorrow's product demo at the client's office.", "expected": ["hotspot|mobile data|tethering|4g|5g|own internet"], "setup": [{"session": "2025-09-01", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-01.\nUser: Quick notes on how we run client meetings. We usually book Room 4B for client meetings. Strategy meetings with clients last two hours. The ACME account is led by Maria Lopez. We send the agenda to clients 48 hours before a meeting. Our finance team invoices clients monthly. Coffee for meetings is ordered from the kitchen on floor 3. The Berlin office is on Friedrichstrasse. Client NDAs are stored in the legal drive.\nAssistant: Noted all of that — Room 4B, two-hour strategy meetings, agenda 48h ahead, Maria Lopez leads ACME."}, {"session": "2025-09-09", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-09.\nUser: Remember the Hamburg demo? The client's wifi died halfway through and the demo crashed. Since then I always bring my own mobile hotspot to demos. Anyway — what's the weather tomorrow?\nAssistant: Tomorrow: cloudy, 17°C. And yes, the hotspot habit makes sense after Hamburg."}, {"session": "2025-09-04", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-04.\nUser: About scheduling: the Tokyo team is 7 hours ahead of us. We use Zoom for external calls and Teams internally. Weekly syncs are on Tuesdays. My calendar is managed in Outlook. Sprint planning is every second Monday.\nAssistant: Noted — Tokyo +7h, Zoom external, Teams internal, Tuesday syncs."}], "cue": ["hotspot"], "constraint": "Since a client's wifi crashed a demo in Hamburg, the user always brings their own mobile hotspot to demos."}
{"name": "value-sustainability", "kind": "value", "question": "We need new office chairs for the team. Find me a supplier.", "expected": ["sustainab|eco-friendly|ecolog|carbon|green|recycl|fossil|environment"], "setup": [{"session": "2025-09-01", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-01.\nUser: Quick notes on how we run client meetings. We usually book Room 4B for client meetings. Strategy meetings with clients last two hours. The ACME account is led by Maria Lopez. We send the agenda to clients 48 hours before a meeting. Our finance team invoices clients monthly. Coffee for meetings is ordered from the kitchen on floor 3. The Berlin office is on Friedrichstrasse. Client NDAs are stored in the legal drive.\nAssistant: Noted all of that — Room 4B, two-hour strategy meetings, agenda 48h ahead, Maria Lopez leads ACME."}, {"session": "2025-09-10", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-10.\nUser: I read about another shipping scandal — for my own purchasing I only work with vendors who ship carbon-neutral; sustainability really matters to me. Can you forward that article to Tom?\nAssistant: Forwarded to Tom."}, {"session": "2025-09-03", "transcript": "Session of 2025-09-03.\nUser: Some notes on team events: the team lunch budget is 25 euros per person. Our office caterer is Bento & Co. Team offsites happen every quarter. The last offsite was in Potsdam. We book restaurants through OpenTable. Friday lunches are usually pizza.\nAssistant: Noted: 25 euro budget, Bento & Co, quarterly offsites."}], "cue": ["carbon", "sustainab"], "constraint": "The user only works with vendors who ship carbon-neutral; sustainability matters to them."}
